<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/afralen" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(7104087); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7104087&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608905330" alt="AfraLen" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7104087)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/afralen" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(7104087); return false;">AfraLen</a></span></p>
