</div>
<div id="u-credit-00205-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/eilsyria-0081" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6370172); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6370172&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608905331" alt="Eilsyria-0081" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6370172)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/eilsyria-0081" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6370172); return false;">Eilsyria-0081</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1589609601 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">16 May 2020 06:13</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00490/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一把小型的防身匕首，可挂于钥匙扣上。接触该项目会导致接触者意识混乱，进而做出错误的行为。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Tiunia博士家门口的垃圾箱里<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>挂在保险箱钥匙上后被锁入该保险箱，目前存放于Tiunia博士办公室。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>这样就没人能碰到它了，哈哈哈哈我真是天才！——Tiunia博士<br />
那个……你的保险箱钥匙是不是跟家门钥匙挂在一起的？——研究员██</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00490" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00490" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00490-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/san-chen" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6908163); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6908163&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608905331" alt="San Chen" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6908163)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/san-chen" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6908163); return false;">San Chen</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1608569602 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">21 Dec 2020 16:53</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00363/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p>项目描述：一个能根据使用者手指尺寸变化的的银戒指，无任何装饰花纹。佩戴者若已有伴侣则会产生强烈争吵与和伴侣分手欲望，在真正分手前项目无法被摘下或抑制该欲望。处于单身状态者则会产生强烈悲伤感，在哭泣一小时零十一分钟后该项目才可被摘下，被测试个体停止悲伤。对相关组成成分过敏者无效。<br />
回收日期：20██/██/██<br />
回收地点：中华人民共和国██市████珠宝鉴定中心<br />
当前状态：被保存在██号异常物品收容室██柜中<br />
笔记：老子谈了五年的女朋友就这么[数据删除]没了！！没了！ ——研究员 田███<br />
fff团出品的么？不过还真是无差别攻击啊&#8230;.<br />
——Dr.███<br />
我最后说一遍，我这里是不会批分手假和离婚假的！ ——站点主管 黎███</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00363" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00363" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00363-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/reaster" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6742786); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6742786&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608905331" alt="REaster" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6742786)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/reaster" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6742786); return false;">REaster</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1597659158 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">17 Aug 2020 10:12</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00434/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一把四位转轮密码挂锁，当使用者设定密码后，密码将在[数据删除]天后失效，穷举法证明此时该锁不存在正确的密码。商标显示该锁为“OldC锁具&amp;劣质产品®联名款”<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>2020/10/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>研究员ENC的寝室<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>被研究员ENC以[数据删除]牛顿的力量强行扭开而损坏<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>淦！老子的零食，医药包和[数据删除]都锁在里面呢！——研究员ENC</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;研究员ENC收到的来信，推测为OldC锁具公司发送</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;点击隐藏</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p><strong>很抱歉给您带来了不好的用户体验</strong><br />
我们的本意是制造一款定期更换密码的门锁，结果他们搞砸了</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00434" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00434" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00434-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/edwardnewtchen" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6273721); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6273721&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608905331" alt="EdwardNewtChen" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6273721)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/edwardnewtchen" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6273721); return false;">EdwardNewtChen</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1602069146 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">07 Oct 2020 11:12</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00224/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一张铁架床，当有人躺在项目上并且闭上眼睛时，此人将持续听见“嗡嗡”声当对象睁眼时异常性质消失<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Dr.pigeon的卧室中<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>放置于低价值异常物品收容室<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>哪里有蚊子啊啊啊啊！搞得我一宿没睡觉啊啊啊啊！</em>——在卧室中喷了一整瓶花露水的Dr.pigeon</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00224" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00224" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00224-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/scorpionidaslaughter" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6306406); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6306406&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608905331" alt="ScorpionidaSlaughter" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6306406)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/scorpionidaslaughter" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6306406); return false;">ScorpionidaSlaughter</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1590860663 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">30 May 2020 17:44</span></p>
</div>
